<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-036" chapter-id="c-nanshi-036-song060-yanghui" source-id="s-nanshi-036-song060-yanghui-ws1489333">
  <p id="c-nanshi-036-song060-yanghui:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-036-song060-yanghui:p001:m0000" ref="qav_j5i_grm">羊欣</persName>，字<persName id="c-nanshi-036-song060-yanghui:p001:m0004" ref="qav_j5i_grm">敬元</persName>，泰山南城人也。曾祖<persName id="c-nanshi-036-song060-yanghui:p001:m0016" ref="wc5_hn7_a5w_A">忱</persName>，晋徐州刺史。祖<persName id="c-nanshi-036-song060-yanghui:p001:m0025" ref="wc5_hn7_a5w_AA">权</persName>，黄门郎。父<persName id="c-nanshi-036-song060-yanghui:p001:m0032" ref="wc5_hn7_a5w_AAA">不疑</persName>，桂阳太守。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-036-song060-yanghui:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">弟<persName id="c-nanshi-036-song060-yanghui:p002:m0001" ref="wc5_hn7_a5w_AAAA">徽</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-036-song060-yanghui:p002:m0003" ref="wc5_hn7_a5w_AAAA">敬猷</persName>，時譽多<persName id="c-nanshi-036-song060-yanghui:p002:m0009" ref="qav_j5i_grm">欣</persName>，位河東太守，卒。</p>
</text>
